     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xml:lang=\"fr-FR\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"fr-FR\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CodeSystem cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType</b></p><a name=\"cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType\"> </a><a name=\"hccs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Langue : fr-FR</p></div><p>This code system supplement <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/fhir/fr/CodeSystem/cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType</code> defines fonctionnalités on the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Affichage</b></td></tr><tr><td><a style=\"white-space:nowrap\" href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-v3-mediaType.html#v3-mediaType-application.47dicom\">application/dicom</a><a name=\"cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType-application.47dicom\"> </a></td><td>DICOM</td></tr><tr><td><a style=\"white-space:nowrap\" href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-v3-mediaType.html#v3-mediaType-application.47msword\">application/msword</a><a name=\"cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType-application.47msword\"> </a></td><td>MSWORD</td></tr><tr><td><a style=\"white-space:nowrap\" href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-v3-mediaType.html#v3-mediaType-application.47pdf\">application/pdf</a><a name=\"cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType-application.47pdf\"> </a></td><td>PDF</td></tr><tr><td><a style=\"white-space:nowrap\" href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-v3-mediaType.html#v3-mediaType-audio.47basic\">audio/basic</a><a name=\"cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType-audio.47basic\"> </a></td><td>Basic Audio</td></tr><tr><td><a style=\"white-space:nowrap\" href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-v3-mediaType.html#v3-mediaType-audio.47k32adpcm\">audio/k32adpcm</a><a name=\"cs-fr-FR-v3-mediaType-audio.47k32adpcm\"> </a></td><td>K32ADPCM Audio</td></tr><tr><td><a style=\